Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.61,0:03:55.58,OP-Jpn,,0,0,0,fx,{\fad(300,500)}Coming for you
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.13,0:04:03.68,OP-Jpn,,0,0,0,fx,{\fad(300,500)}All I ever wanted to do was do right things
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.68,0:04:08.74,OP-Jpn,,0,0,0,fx,{\fad(300,500)}I never wanted to be the king, I swear
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.06,0:04:13.56,OP-Jpn,,0,0,0,fx,{\fad(300,500)}All I ever wanted to do was save your life
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.56,0:04:19.19,OP-Jpn,,0,0,0,fx,{\fad(300,500)}I never wanted to grab a knife, I swear
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.74,0:04:26.72,OP-Jpn,,0,0,0,fx,{\fad(300,500)}Tearless, fearless, burning, burning
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.94,0:04:29.97,OP-Jpn,,0,0,0,fx,{\fad(300,500)}You tell me what have I missed
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.17,0:04:33.89,OP-Jpn,,0,0,0,fx,{\fad(300,500)}Still wandering in the deep mist
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.14,0:04:39.75,OP-Jpn,,0,0,0,fx,{\fad(300,500)}If I lose it all, slip and fall
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.87,0:04:42.48,OP-Jpn,,0,0,0,fx,{\fad(300,500)}I will never look away
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.75,0:04:48.48,OP-Jpn,,0,0,0,fx,{\fad(300,500)}If I lose it all, lose it all, lose it all
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.29,0:04:52.58,OP-Jpn,,0,0,0,fx,{\fad(300,500)}If I lose it all outside the wall
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.58,0:04:55.77,OP-Jpn,,0,0,0,fx,{\fad(300,500)}Live to die another day
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.33,0:04:58.30,OP-Jpn,,0,0,0,fx,{\fad(300,500)}I don't want anything
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.30,0:05:01.54,OP-Jpn,,0,0,0,fx,{\fad(300,500)}I'm just here to…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.57,0:05:05.11,OP-Jpn,,0,0,0,fx,{\fad(300,500)}Beware
